  #line-at(72.024pt, 221.21pt, "depth oscillation frequency, with a damping-induced phase lag between forcing and response. This ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 248.81pt, "coupling generalizes across materials, as shown by AlSi10Mg bare-plate measurements (Extended ")
