  #line-at(72.024pt, 83.18pt, "More broadly, we believe this work lays a general physical foundation for cost-efficient physical ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 110.78pt, "characterization of vapor-jet–cavity dynamics during intense evaporation, which arises across a ")
