  #line-at(72.024pt, 276.41pt, "radiation and validating the mapping against time-resolved geometry—offers a transferable route ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 304.01pt, "for interrogating other non-equilibrium vaporization systems in which driven vapor jets interact ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 331.61pt, "with compliant liquid-vapor interfaces. This perspective opens opportunities for scalable ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 359.23pt, "monitoring, interpretable process conditionings, and feedback-ready control strategies in ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 386.83pt, "vaporization-mediated manufacturing and beyond.  ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "bold", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(72.024pt, 457.99pt, "Conclusions ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(72.024pt, 485.59pt, "We recast ubiquitous aeroacoustic signatures from intense laser-induced vaporizations into cost-")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 513.22pt, "effective microsecond-level probes of transient vapor-cavity depth acceleration and cavity ")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 540.82pt, "oscillation frequency, enabling a noninvasive and scalable route to resolve extremely fast vapor-")
  #line-at(72.024pt, 568.42pt, "jet-driven cavity dynamics. Building on this observability, we develop the ")
